godot/pull/106164.patch","merged_at":"2025-11-07T16:37:19Z"},"body":"See: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/12430, https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/12402\r\nDepends on #106263, #103478, #107395\r\n\r\nCurrently the Bottom Panel inherits from PanelContainer. This makes it hard to integrate with systems like the editor docks that need to make exceptions everywhere in their code for the bottom panel. This PR converts the type of `EditorBottomPanel` to a `TabContainer`. This removes some complexity inside the class as it essentially re-implemented the functionality, but more importantly allows future integrations with the dock system to be much more painless.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106164/reactions","total_count":21,"+1":21,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106164/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}